===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|demain}}, from {{inh|fr|LL.||de māne|of the morning}}, from {{m|la|dē}} + {{inh|fr|la|māne||in the morning}}, from {{der|fr|ine-pro|*meh₂-||to mature, ripen}}. Compare {{cog|it|domani}}, {{cog|ca|demà}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr|Fr-demain.ogg|audio}}
* {{audio|fr|Qc-demain.ogg|Audio (CAN)}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[tomorrow]]
#: {{ux|fr|'''Demain''' c'est dimanche.|'''Tomorrow''' is Sunday.}}

